<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech real Oct construct output up 0.1 pct yr/yr [CORRECTED 08:57 GMT].</title>
<headline>Czech real Oct construct output up 0.1 pct yr/yr [CORRECTED 08:57 GMT].</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Construction output in the Czech Republic rose 0.1 percent in October in real terms compared with the same month in 1995, the Czech Statistical Bureau said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>   CONSTRUCTION OUTPUT   OCT/96  SEPT/96  OCT/95 JAN-OCT/96</p>
<p>(Corrects time period in final column of table from Jan-Sep/96).</p>
<p>   real pct chg yr/yr   +0.1     +10.3    +20.5    +5.5 avg</p>
<p>nominal monthly</p>
<p>    wages chg yr/yr     +15.6    +15.6    +16.0   +15.5</p>
<p>Note: Output figures are based on all sizes of companies. Wage figures are calculated only on the basis of companies with 25 or more employees.</p>
<p>-- Robin Shepherd, Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
